1958
00:54:13,840 --> 00:54:15,160
Hullumeel.

1959
00:54:15,720 --> 00:54:16,960
Hullumeel.

1960
00:54:17,800 --> 00:54:19,040
Hullult kihutav.

1961
00:54:19,600 --> 00:54:21,000
Idioot.

1962
00:54:21,040 --> 00:54:22,400
Hullumeel.

1963
