Ausalt öeldes,

1981
00:54:57,040 --> 00:55:00,200
Ma ei pannud tähele.

1982
00:54:57,040 --> 00:55:00,200
Jamesi uus õnnetus.

1983
00:55:00,240 --> 00:55:04,520
