2030
00:56:55,960 --> 00:56:59,560
aianduskeskus.

2031
00:56:59,600 --> 00:57:03,200
(RAADIOS)

2032
00:56:59,600 --> 00:57:03,200
"Ma soovitan," kirjutas Willhell e-kiri.

2033
00:56:59,600 --> 00:57:03,200
me peaksime töömajad tagasi avama.

2034
00:57:03,240 --> 00:57:05,200
"See peaks inimesi ära hoidma."

2035
00:57:03,240 --> 00:57:05,200
